# Phase 7 BUILD-4X-2 — Stage B PASS (OptiPlex UHD 630, 2026-06-09)
# Source: serial console capture (the OptiPlex booted on NVMe; durable block-sink
# extractable later via ssh dd once back on the live-USB). The earlier two boots
# stopped during SMP bring-up (intermittent LAPIC/IPI flake) before the dispatch;
# this cold boot (ticks=19) got past it and ran the Add to completion.
#
# Self-proving gate: the Add's data buffers (lhs/rhs/output) are ACTIVELY CLEARED
# from GGTT (ggtt-pte-clear), mapped ONLY in the per-context 48-bit PML4. A correct
# [4.0, 6.0] is therefore only possible if the EU's A64 data accesses resolved
# through the per-context PPGTT — BUILD-4-1's select=PPGTT device boundary, achieved
# on the execlist context proven by 4X-1.

